{"id":"jn5ikzm23crbh790t075xg5sw","title":"中国香港通过加密资产税务申报法案，2027 年起实施","originalTitle":null,"summary":"中国香港立法会通过《2026 年税务条例修订草案》，落实 OECD 加密资产申报框架 CARF（2027 年生效）及修订版共同申报准则 CRS（2028 年自动交换税务信息，2029 年自动交换金融账户信息）。香港财政司司长许正宇称此举旨在巩固国际金融中心地位。","reason":"法案明确实施时间与信息交换范围，读者可据此预判跨境税务合规成本变化。","source":{"name":"链捕手 ChainCatcher"},"links":{"original":"https://www.chaincatcher.com/article/2301713"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-04T10:34:04.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-04T13:32:18.444Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-04T13:32:18.444Z","category":"crypto-policy","tags":["政策发布"],"score":85,"selected":true,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"43bd26f6-af26-4197-9ec1-8ac809e888a8","title":"中国香港通过加密资产税务框架法案分阶段对接国际标准"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"43bd26f6-af26-4197-9ec1-8ac809e888a8","title":"中国香港通过加密资产税务框架法案分阶段对接国际标准"}],"topics":[{"slug":"regulation","name":"监管与政策"}],"indexable":true,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"f2-UqrhZaVvU","reportCount":3,"additionalSourceCount":2},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}